    "blocks": [
      {
        "id": "textbook-domain-intro",
        "moduleId": "domain-basics",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "definition",
        "title": "教材步骤：确认 Web 应用的域名",
        "markdown": "创建 Web 应用时，平台会为程序确定一个访问地址，这一步的页面标题是 “Your web app's domain name”。教材页面提示：账户不支持自定义域名时，Web 应用将运行在 `greyli.pythonanywhere.com` 这样的地址上。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-e0a0d38f117bfe9c05dd311f",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000100"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "第 11 章：部署上线",
                "Your web app's domain name"
              ],
              "lineStart": 747,
              "lineEnd": 753,
              "assetRefs": [],
              "excerptSha256": "ad83b8c67b00bc146b7e2cc75448d7033d96fedda2b461044a1a1f839e443d59"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "model-username-rule",
        "moduleId": "domain-basics",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "explanation",
        "title": "补充说明：地址并不是现场起名",
        "markdown": "这个地址不是随机字符串，而是由注册时填写的用户名决定的。用户名同时充当 Linux 用户名，并作为程序域名的子域前缀，所以访问地址形如 `http://<username>.pythonanywhere.com/`。换句话说，域名步骤主要是让你确认平台按用户名算出的地址，而不是在这里重新命名应用。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "textbook-domain-intro"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "model-greyli-example",
        "moduleId": "domain-basics",
        "depth": "support",
        "kind": "example",
        "title": "教材示例：greyli 的访问地址",
        "markdown": "教材用 `greyli` 作为用户名示例：如果注册用户名为 greyli，最终分配的程序域名就是 `http://greyli.pythonanywhere.com/`。把自己的注册用户名替换进去，就能在创建之前推断出访问地址。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "textbook-domain-intro",
            "model-username-rule"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "textbook-free-plan-note",
        "moduleId": "free-plan-boundary",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "note",
        "title": "教材提示：免费账户不支持自定义域名",
        "markdown": "免费账户不支持自定义域名。创建页在这一步明确提示：想改变域名需要升级账户；如果没有升级计划，直接点击 “Next” 即可继续，平台仍会按用户名分配可用的访问地址。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-e0a0d38f117bfe9c05dd311f",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000100"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "第 11 章：部署上线",
                "Your web app's domain name"
              ],
              "lineStart": 747,
              "lineEnd": 753,
              "assetRefs": [],
              "excerptSha256": "ad83b8c67b00bc146b7e2cc75448d7033d96fedda2b461044a1a1f839e443d59"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "model-custom-domain-misconception",
        "moduleId": "free-plan-boundary",
        "depth": "support",
        "kind": "misconception",
        "title": "澄清：免费账户不能绑定独立域名",
        "markdown": "常见误解是“免费账户可以直接绑定自己的独立域名”。实际上免费方案只提供 `<username>.pythonanywhere.com` 这一种地址；只有升级账户后，页面才提供更改域名的选项。另一个误解是“必须升级才能继续”，而教材明确说明不升级也可以点击 “Next” 继续创建流程。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "textbook-free-plan-note"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "model-free-vs-upgrade",
        "moduleId": "free-plan-boundary",
        "depth": "support",
        "kind": "comparison",
        "title": "对比：免费地址与升级后的自定义域名",
        "markdown": "可以从三个维度比较两种选择：\n\n- 域名形式：免费账户是用户名子域名，升级后可按账户能力配置自定义域名。\n- 额外成本：免费账户无需付费，升级通常涉及付费。\n- 对当前流程的影响：两种选择都能继续完成 Web 应用创建，区别只在最终对外使用的地址。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "textbook-free-plan-note"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "textbook-continue-next",
        "moduleId": "domain-step-walkthrough",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "procedure",
        "title": "教材流程：点击 Next 进入框架选择",
        "markdown": "确认域名提示后，点击 “Next” 进入下一步。教材紧接着说明，这一步是选择 Web 框架，为了获得更灵活的控制应选择手动设置（Manual configuration），之后还会选择 Python 版本。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-e0a0d38f117bfe9c05dd311f",
